      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target audience for this meme is individuals familiar with or interested in cultural comparisons, particularly between American and Romanian culinary traditions. The meme appeals to people who understand or are curious about holiday food customs, especially Thanksgiving in the USA and traditional Romanian meals. It is designed for an audience that appreciates internet humor based on cultural stereotypes and visual juxtapositions, likely including those who are aware of or have encountered the trope of 'how to cook turkey in [country]' memes. The audience may include food enthusiasts, culture vultures, or meme creators/consumers who enjoy light-hearted, stereotypical comparisons between nations.",
